Z||000000||newfie||12-06-2000||06:33 PM||||I came across this V8 fiero kit today on the net.  I've never heard about it before, I think its a good idea using different length axle shafts to centre the motor.  This saves from cutting the frame or body to clear the pulleys and must improve handling somewhat.  The price seems alright, shipping would probably be better for me seeing as its in Canada.  Just wondering if anyone has any comments on it.  Address is;<BR> <A HREF="http://www.hi-techdev.com" TARGET=_blank>www.hi-techdev.com</A> ||||reg||5
