Z||000011||Slammed Fiero||12-07-2000||10:10 AM||||For Hi Tech Development kit you do need a slew of extra parts , I have seen their demo car looked like a nice install. The guy who runs it used to race corvairs with my dad a number of years ago ..Seems like a lot of people move from Vairs to Fiero's ...<P><P>------------------<BR>Jonathan M McCreery<BR>86 GT<BR>17" Tr motorsports Typhoons Ground Control coil overs , Big bars front and rear , Mustang scoop , accel coil , no cat , 4spd , short shift , poly dog bone and bushings momo pedals and shift knob , round headlight conversion , Geni stainless steel oval exhaust tips. Pioneer 6000 CD player , Sony Mobile Amp. Currently doing big brake conversion...||||reg||1
